#: includes/class-mpc-plugin.php:6500
msgid "Last suggestions lists products that already have a suggestion, so you can ask the AI again. A product that already has a suggestion leaves this list. It stays in Recent suggestions below, and the full product comes back here when you search or choose Last suggestions. Suggest all covers only the products on this page. Apply checked fields on each product saves the title and descriptions."
